<title>UK: IBCA rates Bayerische Vereinsbank notes AA+ l-term.</title>
<headline>IBCA rates Bayerische Vereinsbank notes AA+ l-term.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>IBCA, the European credit rating agency, said on Tuesday it had assigned an AA plus long-term rating to the 100 million stg issue of 7.5 percent 2002 notes of Bayerische Vereinsbank.  </p>
<p>&quot;Despute the current exceedingly competitive nature of the German banking industry, Bayerische Vereinsbank remains one of the best performing and most financially stable German financial institutions and this is reflected in its credit ratings.&quot; IBCA said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Kate Kelland, International Bonds Unit +44 171 542 8682</p>
